<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
The name of the mod type the ``.ini`` file was classified as, or ``std::nullopt`` when
it was never classified (``ini.getFixModTypeName()``) :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;` :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`

